Let me add why I personally wouldn't use this patch. I like the color HP
patch a lot, because a change in color on the status line immediately
draws my attention to it. The color changes at once when a hit gets
through (gray->green), and then again at critical marks. Your AC color
idea would produce a permanent color in the status line. A sudden change
that needs your attention, like a disintegrated or stolen piece of
armor, is likely not to affect the color at all, when the net AC doesn't
cross a threshold. Thus, the coloured AC entry would mainly be a
_distraction_ from other colored entries that give an important warning.

AC changes slowly during a game, there is no need to draw extra
attention to the players AC when there's nothing to be immediately done
about it.

